# du(1)

## NAME

du - estimate file space usage

## SYNOPSIS

    du [-as] [-b|-k] [file...]

## DESCRIPTION

Writes the total size of the files under each path (default `.`), one line per directory, as `KiB<TAB>path`. Sizes are file sizes rounded up to KiB, not disk blocks. Symbolic links are not followed.

## OPTIONS

- `-a`: also list files
- `-s`: only the total for each operand
- `-b`: sizes in bytes
- `-k`: sizes in KiB (the default)

## SEE ALSO

df(1), ls(1)
